), so all are \\\\(25\\\\), whose sum cannot be \\\\(213\\\\).\\n\\nTherefore \\\\(189\\\\le s\\\\le211\\\\), which is exactly \\\\(200-11\\\\le s\\\\le200+11\\\\). Hence \\\\(N=11\\\\) is sufficient, and the lower-bound construction proves it is minimal.\"}",
